  P17.4 measured values -- the IMPLEMENTED operator
  mesh 10x10 over 20.0 x 20.0  =>  h = 2   cell volume = 4
  
  ### A. U = (x^2/2, 0)  =>  div U = x,  grad(div U) = (1, 0) analytically
    worst |div U - x|, ALL cells                 10
    worst |div U - x|, boundary-adjacent cells    10
    worst |div U - x|, interior cells             0
    deep-interior cells (2+ cells from any wall) 36
    worst |grad(div U).x - 1|, deep interior     0
    expected contribution -(2/3)*mu*1*V          -0.26666666666666666
    worst |rhs - expected|, deep interior        0
    V_P sensitivity: with V=1 the expected value would be -0.066666666666666666
      => dropping the V_P factor is a factor-4 error, which is what makes
         control N2b non-vacuous (it was a no-op when V was exactly 1).
  
  ### B. a divergence-free field must give EXACTLY zero
    worst |rhs|                 0
    cells with rhs != 0         0  (0 = bitwise zero everywhere)
  
  ### C. linear in mu, and exactly zero at mu = 0
    probe cell 22 at (5, 5), deep interior
    mu 0.00   -> rhs[22] = 0                        expected -(2/3)*mu*1*V = -0
    mu 0.05   -> rhs[22] = -0.13333333333333333     expected -(2/3)*mu*1*V = -0.13333333333333333
    mu 0.10   -> rhs[22] = -0.26666666666666666     expected -(2/3)*mu*1*V = -0.26666666666666666
    mu 0.20   -> rhs[22] = -0.53333333333333333     expected -(2/3)*mu*1*V = -0.53333333333333333
  
  ### D. through assembleRelaxedCompressibleMomentumComponent (the wired path)
    cells where on != off                        100 of 100
    worst |(on - off) - standalone operator|      1.4432899320127035e-15
      => the wiring is not merely present, it delivers exactly the operator
    cells where DEFAULT == off (bitwise)         100 of 100  (n = default off)
    divergence-free field: cells where on != off 0  (0 = incompressible
                                                    limit is undisturbed)
  
  ### E. the boundary limitation -- why the claim is deep-interior only
    worst |grad(div U).x - 1|, ALL cells          2.5
    worst, ONE cell in from the boundary          2.5
    worst, TWO cells in (the deep interior)       0
      => the artificial zero-gradient BC on the derived scalar div U pollutes
